              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mana abakhulundu babaFilisiti nibarula; ne buli olwa barulanga lwosi, Daudi yakaasanga okhushila abasumba bosi baSaulo; okhuula olwa eliiralie liafuma muno.",
